Rotten food can blind you, confuse you or cause you to pass out.
Passing out renders you helpless for something like five turns. Can be
a serious problem in the vicinity of nasties, as you, alas, observed.
And rings of free action apparently don't prevent it. Practically any
sort of food can be rotten, it's just that cursed food is always (or
nearly always) rotten and uncursed/blessed food only occasionally.
There may be a few exceptions.

